{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"bed2a8c68cd8d708fe0e0f16d44c23b65411d7d0daaaf5608d8b4446ac6a3d0d","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review gate coaching and workflow","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/plan-review.yaml","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/workflow_ops.py","src/rebar/schemas/plan_review_coach_inputs_output.schema.json","src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/coach.py","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sidecar.py","src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_coach.md","src/rebar/llm/plan_review/orchestrator.py","src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py","plan_review_coach_inputs","plan_review_coach","coach_inputs","coach_gate","coach_notes","render_coach_notes","build_payload","decision"],"problem_keywords":["coaching","blocking findings","guide url","plan review","decision tag","advisory findings"],"propositions":["Blocking findings currently receive no coaching note, guide_url, or move-registry nudge, only surviving advisory findings do; this causes recurrent remediation delays when agents reword acceptance criteria instead of adding demanded oracle code.","The plan_review_coach_inputs operation and coach_gate branch condition must be widened to accept and emit blocking findings alongside surviving findings, with blocking findings listed first.","The plan_review_coach workflow operation must derive its move-trigger set from the union of blocking and surfaced (surviving) findings rather than surfaced alone.","Rendered coaching entries must carry a decision tag (\"block\" or \"advisory\") through the sidecar slim payload and prompt framing to preserve decision context.","The plan-review.yaml workflow (both verify_branch then-arm and else-arm) must apply identical edits to their structurally duplicate coach_inputs/coach_gate/coach_notes/coach blocks to keep them binding-identical.","Coaching notes for blocking findings must pass the same C1 subject validation as advisory notes, and rendering must remain decision-neutral without code or imperatives."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785821485177791296,"uuid":"5c3c9518-98fb-4ee0-9261-f7c9e8bfc441"}